# Play test of Old Vine Hill (CIPlay old_vine_hill, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The press house in the saddle (x -4..2, z -1.5..7.5, 8 m; door south), the terraces (Sunrise z 31, Chapel z 26 on the
# east peak; Stony z -33, Old Wall z -27 on the west peak), the cellar on the west flank (x -51.5..-42.5, z -3..3, 6 m;
# door east at z -3..0), the reserve vault off the west shore (x -71.5..-62.5, z -3..3, floor 5 m down; door east), the grave on
# the east top (8 20, 23.5 m).
# Quest (11 steps): the press house, the letter, two hens, the Old Wall terrace, its boars, five pages, the cellar, the
# vault, the reserve vault opened, the grave, the toast.
island Old Vine Hill
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Founding Vintage
wait 5
expect animals Chicken 3
expect animals Goat 3
expect animals Dolphin 2
at -1 -7 h=9
walk -1 -6.5 to -1 -3 h=8
zone presshouse
expect step 1
read Tomas's letter
expect step 2
catch Chicken 2
expect step 3
zone topterrace
expect step 4
kill Warthog
expect step 5
read Label of the Sunrise terrace
read Label of the Chapel terrace
read Label of the Stony terrace
read Label of the Old Wall terrace
expect step 6
at -39 -1.5 h=7
walk -39 -1.5 to -45 -1.5 h=6.05
zone cellar
expect step 7
use caskchapel
expect message It just drips
use caskoldwall
use casksunrise
use caskstony
use caskchapel
expect shown vault
wait 4
at -66 -1 h=-4.5
zone vault
expect step 8
open Reserve vault
expect story firstvintage 1
expect step 9
at 8 18 h=24.5
zone gravetop
expect step 10
use grave
expect shown toast
read The vintner's toast
expect done
